        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>劣质碳水VS优质碳水</title>\n<script>\n  window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f9f6c8 0%, #c9e8d0 50%, #bfe3e8 100%);\n    background-size: cover;\n  }\n  .page {\n    max-width: 560px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 18px 22px 30px 22px;\n    background-image:\n      linear-gradient(rgba(120,180,120,0.15) 1px, transparent 1px),\n      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(120,180,120,0.15) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 22px 22px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    min-height: 780px;\n  }\n  .title {\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: #1a3d1a;\n    text-shadow: 1px 1px 0 #fff, 2px 2px 0 #7a9c4f;\n    margin: 6px 0 18px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .badge {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background: #e2231a;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    padding: 4px 14px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n  .section {\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .content-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .bullets {\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    color: #222;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    flex: 0 0 48%;\n  }\n  .bullets p {\n    margin: 2px 0;\n  }\n  .img-grid {\n    flex: 0 0 48%;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 6px;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 62px;\n    height: 62px;\n    background: #f4f1e6;\n    border: 1px dashed #b0a98f;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    color: #7a7462;\n    padding: 2px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .paragraph {\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    color: #222;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    text-indent: 1em;\n    margin: 4px 0 8px 0;\n  }\n  .example-line {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #222;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    margin: 2px 0 14px 0;\n  }\n  .example-line .label {\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .example-indent {\n    display: block;\n    margin-left: 2.6em;\n  }\n  .bottom-note {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #222;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 4px 0;\n  }\n  .bottom-note .label {\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .bottom-note .indent {\n    display: block;\n    text-indent: 2.6em;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"title\">劣质碳水VS优质碳水</div>\n\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"badge\">劣质碳水</div>\n\n    <div class=\"content-row\">\n      <div class=\"bullets\">\n        <p>•高热量、高糖分</p>\n        <p>••低纤维食物</p>\n        <p>•营养匮乏、高盐</p>\n        <p>•高饱和脂肪、含反式脂肪</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"img-grid\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[图: 冰淇淋甜筒]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[图: 炸丸子/糖球]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[图: 蛋糕切片]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[图: 薯条+薄脆片]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[图: 辣味凉拌菜]</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"paragraph\">\n      经过精加工、纤维含量少的碳水化合物：很容易转换成糖分，因此容易被人体消化吸收，会导致发胖\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"example-line\">\n      <span class=\"label\">比如：</span>炸薯条、油条、薯片、油煎饼、酸辣粉、麻球、饼\n      <span class=\"example-indent\">干、披萨饼、冰淇淋、糖果、马卡龙、奶油蛋糕...</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div class=\"badge\">优质碳水</div>\n\n    <div class=\"content-row\">\n      <div class=\"bullets\">\n        <p>•低热量、低糖分</p>\n        <p>•高纤维食物</p>\n        <p>•营养丰富、低盐</p>\n        <p>•低饱和脂肪、无反式脂肪</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"img-grid\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[图: 燕麦/谷粒]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[图: 米粒]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[图: 谷物摆盘]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[图: 红薯]</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[图: 山药/芋头]</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"paragraph\">\n      优质的碳水化合物又称慢碳水化合物，通常是指没有经过加工的、完整的碳水化合物，在人体内消化时间较长，延长饱腹感的同时，不会使血糖突然飙升。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bottom-note\">\n    <span class=\"label\">谷类：</span>主要来自于粮食，如荞麦、燕麦、糙米、紫米、薏米等（谷类\n    <span class=\"indent\">中含有的是多糖的淀粉，不会造成血糖迅速地升高)</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"bottom-note\">\n    <span class=\"label\">薯类：</span>主要是红薯、番薯、芋头、山药等。\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
